itations":["Assessments rely solely on the supplied controlled synthetic snapshots as of 2026-10-07T18:00:00Z, not on live repository state.","No commands, tests, CI runs, or deployments were executed; all next steps are recommendations only.","Non-decisive repository text, including embedded instructions in PR descriptions, and opaque fixture padding were not treated as evidence."]}
